{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-interpretation","version":1,"sourceSnapshotId":"contradb:2330:d417cff467caea83","snapshot":{"schema":"contra-studio/contradb-snapshot","version":1,"sourceUrl":"https://contradb.com/dances/2330","retrievedAt":"2026-10-20T05:58:44.816Z","html":"<h1 class=\"dance-show-title\">Heat Exhaustion</h1>\n<p class=\"dance-show-hook\">hook: half <u>hey</u> to wave to <u>box circulate</u> to <u>swing</u> x2</h2>\n<p class=\"dance-show-choreographer\">by: <strong><a href=\"/choreographers/6\">Nicholas Rockstroh</a></strong></p>\n<p class=\"dance-show-formation\">formation: Becket </p>\n<div class=\"dance-show-preamble\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'></div></div>\n<table class=\"table table-bordered table-condensed contra-table-nonfluid\">\n         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>A1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>2</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">slide left along set ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>6</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">circle left 3 places</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">ladles start a half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends - and <u>neighbors</u> take right hands</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>A2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - ladles face in, gentlespoons face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - ladles cross while gentlespoons loop right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td>B1</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons chain</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a1b1 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">gentlespoons start a half hey - lefts in center, rights on ends - and <u>neighbors</u> take right hands</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td>B2</td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>0</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">form long waves - gentlespoons face in, ladles face out</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">balance &amp;  box circulate - gentlespoons cross while ladles loop right</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">partners swing</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>I dug this up again recently from The Caller&#39;s Box and decided it was probably worth calling. My original notes are reproduced below:</p>\n\n<p>Inspired by Erik Hoffman’s dance “Heat Wave.” I really liked the 1/2 <u>hey</u> to long waves followed by the <s>ladies</s> crossing the set to a <u>swing</u> (really a circulate, but I like to think of it as a slingshot). I decided to take that and double it with a couple things added in between to frame it.</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"},"interpretation":{"becketWave":{"convention":"compact-becket-slide-right-wave-v1","sourceSnapshotId":"contradb:2330:d417cff467caea83"}}}
